# steward-tailscale's settings, for the tailscale profile of deploy/compose.yml (docs/quickstart/install.md). Copy this file to
# tailscale.env beside compose.yml, then chmod 600 tailscale.env. Turn on MagicDNS and HTTPS certificates in your
# tailnet's admin console first. One setting per line, and end the file with a line break.
# A one-off auth key from login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys. It's used once: after the first sign-in the
# machine's identity is kept in the tailscale-state volume, and this line can go.
TS_AUTHKEY=
